</fpage><lpage>96</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1515/BOT.1999.011</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Castric-Fey A, Beaupoilard C, Bouchain J, Pradier E, Th. L&#x02019;Hardy-Halos M (1999b) The introduced alga Undaria pinnatifida (Laminariales, Alariaceae) in the rocky shore ecosystem of the St Malo area: Growth rate and longevity of the sporophyte. Bot Mar 42:83&#x02013;96 </citation></ref><ref id="CR5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>YS</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Nam</surname><given-names>KW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of daylength, irradiance and settlement density on the growth and reproduction of <italic>Undaria pinnatifida</italic> gametophytes</article-title><source>J Appl Phycol</source><year>2005</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>423</fpage><lpage>430</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10811-005-0432-2</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Choi HG, Kim YS, Lee SJ, Park EJ, Nam KW (2005) Effects of daylength, irradiance and settlement density on the growth and reproduction of Undaria pinnatifida gametophytes. J Appl Phycol 17:423&#x02013;430 </citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ishikawa</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A simple method for growth estimation of blades in <italic>Undaria pinnatifida</italic></article-title><source>Nippon Suisan Gakkaishi</source><year>1993</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>1331</fpage><lpage>1336</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Ishikawa Y (1993) A simple method for growth estimation of blades in Undaria pinnatifida. Nippon Suisan Gakkaishi 59:1331&#x02013;1336 </citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koh</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Shin</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Growth and size distribution of some large brown algae in Ohori, east coast of Korea</article-title><source>Hydrobiologia</source><year>1990</year><volume>204/205</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>231</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF00040238</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Koh CH, Shin HC (1990) Growth and size distribution of some large brown algae in Ohori, east coast of Korea. Hydrobiologia 204/205:225&#x02013;231 </citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>KY</given-names></name><name><surname>Sohn</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Morphological characteristics and growth of two forms of sea mustard, <italic>Undaria pinnatifida</italic> f. <italic>distans</italic> and of <italic>U. pinnatifida</italic> f. <italic>typica</italic></article-title><source>J Aquacult</source><year>1993</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>87</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Lee KY, Sohn CH (1993) Morphological characteristics and growth of two forms of sea mustard, Undaria pinnatifida f. distans and of U. pinnatifida f. typica. J Aquacult 6:71&#x02013;87 </citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>L&#x000fc;ning</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Photoperiodic control of sorus formation in the brown alga <italic>Laminaria saccharina</italic></article-title><source>Mar Ecol Progr Ser</source><year>1988</year><volume>45<